<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the first round of</p>
<p>the Amsterdam Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Jan van Lottum (Netherlands) beat Filip DeWulf (Belgium) 7-5</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Sjeng Schjalken (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat Fernon Wibier (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Hircham Arazi (Morocco) beat Fernando Meligent (Brazil) 2-6 6-1</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>1-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Grogory Carraz (France) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Alberto Martin (Spain) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>4-Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Domininik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 5-7</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat 3-Alberto Berasategui 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-3 3-6 4-0</p>
<p>(Blanco retired after injury)</p>
</text>
